(6772180, 1016047, 143116, '<td valign="top">Very nice photograph, best I''ve scored so far. I like the overall tone, the clear and simple subject, her looks, the bokeh and tone in the background. Could well be a winner, but ... The use of "negative space" unsettles me. The emptiness on the left where the girl isn''t looking keeps drawing my attention, where I feel my attention should be drawn to the top right, where the drops come from.</td>', 'Very nice photograph, best I''ve scored so far. I like the overall tone, the clear and simple subject, her looks, the bokeh and tone in the background. Could well be a winner, but ... The use of "negative space" unsettles me. The emptiness on the left where the girl isn''t looking keeps drawing my attention, where I feel my attention should be drawn to the top right, where the drops come from.', '2012-05-18 03:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6772181, 1016075, 100393, '<td valign="top">Perfect.</td>', 'Perfect.', '2012-05-18 03:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6772263, 1015270, 142363, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh - I love this picture.  It just embodies misery for me.  And yet, it makes me giggle at the same time.  Really love this.</td>', 'Oh my gosh - I love this picture.  It just embodies misery for me.  And yet, it makes me giggle at the same time.  Really love this.', '2012-05-18 04:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6772264, 1015035, 142363, '<td valign="top">First look, "Is that someone''s...."  Second look, "WHY is there a random butt in the picture"  Third look, "Who is this guy in front and why is he unphased by the random butt in the background"<br/> <br/>The fact is that I KEEP looking and that the photograph totally draws me in - and how cool is that background?  How did you do that?<br/> <br/>Awesome - this is one of my favorites of the challenge.  Not sure how the masses will feel, but I absolutely loved it.</td>', 'First look, "Is that someone''s...."  Second look, "WHY is there a random butt in the picture"  Third look, "Who is this guy in front and why is he unphased by the random butt in the background" The fact is that I KEEP looking and that the photograph totally draws me in - and how cool is that background?  How did you do that? Awesome - this is one of my favorites of the challenge.  Not sure how the masses will feel, but I absolutely loved it.', '2012-05-18 04:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6772265, 1015958, 142363, '<td valign="top">I like this one - partially because it''s obvious the subject is actually in the rain, and you feel that dampness - partially because it''s simplicity is just beautiful.</td>', 'I like this one - partially because it''s obvious the subject is actually in the rain, and you feel that dampness - partially because it''s simplicity is just beautiful.', '2012-05-18 04:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
