(6772274, 1015430, 129512, '<td valign="top">I knew I recognized this from somewhere.<a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=968773" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1443/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_968773.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1443/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_968773.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1443/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_968773.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Loved it then, Love it now.<br/> <br/>Nicely done.</td>', 'I knew I recognized this from somewhere.  Loved it then, Love it now. Nicely done.', '2012-05-18 04:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6772279, 1015905, 142363, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely haunting portrait - you''ve captured a fabulous moment and an emotion so beautifully.  The only reason I didn''t score it quite highly is that I didn''t get a sense of her being ''in the rain'' - I did get that she has wet hair, but that didnt'' automatically translate to rain for me.  Can I just say again, though - I really love this.  This is one of those portraits that stick with you and make you wonder about the backstory behind it.</td>', 'This is an absolutely haunting portrait - you''ve captured a fabulous moment and an emotion so beautifully.  The only reason I didn''t score it quite highly is that I didn''t get a sense of her being ''in the rain'' - I did get that she has wet hair, but that didnt'' automatically translate to rain for me.  Can I just say again, though - I really love this.  This is one of those portraits that stick with you and make you wonder about the backstory behind it.', '2012-05-18 05:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
