(6773028, 1015581, 99412, '<td valign="top">I gave this photograph a 10 only because I couldn''t give it a 12.</td>', 'I gave this photograph a 10 only because I couldn''t give it a 12.', '2012-05-19 08:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773048, 1015659, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is simple and very well done. A nice feeling of Zen and peace. One of my highest scored images, and hopefully proof to many that basic/advanced editing shots can do well in expert challenges.</td>', 'This is simple and very well done. A nice feeling of Zen and peace. One of my highest scored images, and hopefully proof to many that basic/advanced editing shots can do well in expert challenges.', '2012-05-19 10:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773052, 1016069, 125275, '<td valign="top">Very interesting perspective and tied for my highest scoring.<br/> <br/>On a side note, this image appears to be in the Adobe RGB color space. As far as I know, browsers read JPG files in sRGB color space, so Adobe RGB files will show up with slightly different (and somewhat unpredictable) colors than intended. I shoot in aRGB also, but make sure to convert the color profile upon saving. Save for Web will automatically do so.<br/> <br/>I think in this instance the color shifts add to the image. The street, instead of appearing gray, appears to have a greenish tint. I like the effect, but it might be unintended.</td>', 'Very interesting perspective and tied for my highest scoring. On a side note, this image appears to be in the Adobe RGB color space. As far as I know, browsers read JPG files in sRGB color space, so Adobe RGB files will show up with slightly different (and somewhat unpredictable) colors than intended. I shoot in aRGB also, but make sure to convert the color profile upon saving. Save for Web will automatically do so. I think in this instance the color shifts add to the image. The street, instead of appearing gray, appears to have a greenish tint. I like the effect, but it might be unintended.', '2012-05-19 10:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773053, 1016033, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is great!</td>', 'This is great!', '2012-05-19 10:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773057, 1016037, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is awesome. I love the simplicity of it.</td>', 'This is awesome. I love the simplicity of it.', '2012-05-19 10:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
