(6774217, 1015831, 148679, '<td valign="top">I like how the rain looks like specs of light.  The photo is framed nicely, and the lit up fair has vibrant colors.</td>', 'I like how the rain looks like specs of light.  The photo is framed nicely, and the lit up fair has vibrant colors.', '2012-05-21 07:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774219, 1015581, 148679, '<td valign="top">Seems like an interesting idea, however I don''t understand why he is pulling the rain cloud.  The main thing that bothers me about this picture is the way the rope around the cloud looks.  I feel like it should be so defined.  It really pulls your attension away from the rest of the picture.  It would have been better with it just being one loop instead of five.  The rain looks nice, everythign else I like.</td>', 'Seems like an interesting idea, however I don''t understand why he is pulling the rain cloud.  The main thing that bothers me about this picture is the way the rope around the cloud looks.  I feel like it should be so defined.  It really pulls your attension away from the rest of the picture.  It would have been better with it just being one loop instead of five.  The rain looks nice, everythign else I like.', '2012-05-21 07:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774220, 1016053, 148679, '<td valign="top">less is more.  It tooke me a while to even notice that the tree was shaped like a man and he had a pipe, because I was so distracted by the girl with the umbrella.  I love the creativity.  Looks realistic.  I can''t put my finger on it, but something seems off....... maybe the framing, or maybe its the girl with umbrella, I am not sure.  Overall, I think it is a nice picture.</td>', 'less is more.  It tooke me a while to even notice that the tree was shaped like a man and he had a pipe, because I was so distracted by the girl with the umbrella.  I love the creativity.  Looks realistic.  I can''t put my finger on it, but something seems off....... maybe the framing, or maybe its the girl with umbrella, I am not sure.  Overall, I think it is a nice picture.', '2012-05-21 07:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774221, 1015988, 148679, '<td valign="top">Pretty, but I feel like this picture is missing something.  Too much blankness in the left area.</td>', 'Pretty, but I feel like this picture is missing something.  Too much blankness in the left area.', '2012-05-21 07:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774222, 1016037, 148679, '<td valign="top">Very creative, and I love the shadow hand.</td>', 'Very creative, and I love the shadow hand.', '2012-05-21 07:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774225, 1016059, 148679, '<td valign="top">I really like the horizontal blur effect.  I like how you can still see the street lines and the figure of the person with an umbrella.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I really like the horizontal blur effect.  I like how you can still see the street lines and the figure of the person with an umbrella.  Nicely done.', '2012-05-21 07:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774227, 1016069, 148679, '<td valign="top">Probably one of my favorites that I have seen so far in the contest.  I love how it looks like her reflection is actually the girl walking, and I love the vibrant pink.  The white arrow was a nice touch to the composition!</td>', 'Probably one of my favorites that I have seen so far in the contest.  I love how it looks like her reflection is actually the girl walking, and I love the vibrant pink.  The white arrow was a nice touch to the composition!', '2012-05-21 07:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774228, 1015043, 148679, '<td valign="top">love the blue bird and its expression.  I also love the rain and how it almost looks like snow.  Great composition.</td>', 'love the blue bird and its expression.  I also love the rain and how it almost looks like snow.  Great composition.', '2012-05-21 07:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774231, 1015270, 148679, '<td valign="top">I love how the rain looks like long streaks, but you can see the frogs face very defined.  I love the coloring of the frog and how it is looking up at you.</td>', 'I love how the rain looks like long streaks, but you can see the frogs face very defined.  I love the coloring of the frog and how it is looking up at you.', '2012-05-21 07:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774384, 1015543, 10848, '<td valign="top">Very impressive!</td>', 'Very impressive!', '2012-05-21 12:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
