(6777686, 1016068, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like the pop of color against the green and I also like the background blur here. Otherwise it''s a bit busy with an uneven field of focus due to the chaotic nature of the tree growth.</td>', 'I like the pop of color against the green and I also like the background blur here. Otherwise it''s a bit busy with an uneven field of focus due to the chaotic nature of the tree growth.', '2012-05-24 22:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6777731, 1015043, 50695, '<td valign="top">Before you thought of spring,<br/>Except as a surmise,<br/>You see, God bless his suddenness,<br/>A fellow in the skies<br/>Of independent hues,<br/>A little weather-worn,<br/>Inspiriting habiliments<br/>Of indigo and brown.<br/>With specimens of song,<br/>As if for you to choose,<br/>Discretion in the interval,<br/>With gay delays he goes<br/>To some superior tree<br/>Without a single leaf,<br/>And shouts for joy to nobody<br/>But his seraphic self!</td>', 'Before you thought of spring,Except as a surmise,You see, God bless his suddenness,A fellow in the skiesOf independent hues,A little weather-worn,Inspiriting habilimentsOf indigo and brown.With specimens of song,As if for you to choose,Discretion in the interval,With gay delays he goesTo some superior treeWithout a single leaf,And shouts for joy to nobodyBut his seraphic self!', '2012-05-24 22:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
