(6777822, 1016060, 114285, '<td valign="top">Love this one, has mood written all over it!!<br/> <br/>Going to bump this to a 10, the low contrast look is so fitting to this challenge, love how she is standing there, hair swept, and all, waiting for her impending doom, or so it seems.<br/> <br/>You have created something to behold!!<br/> <br/>You enter my Verineat gallery <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1014169" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Love this one, has mood written all over it!! Going to bump this to a 10, the low contrast look is so fitting to this challenge, love how she is standing there, hair swept, and all, waiting for her impending doom, or so it seems. You have created something to behold!! You enter my Verineat gallery ', '2012-05-25 00:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
