(6777841, 1015659, 96664, '<td valign="top">I am jumping this one up to a 9 from the 8 I gave during the week. I keep coming back to it. Which is why I upped it. I love the textures here. Tone is perfect... The reason I am not giving it a 10 is because I would have liked to have seen more.</td>', 'I am jumping this one up to a 9 from the 8 I gave during the week. I keep coming back to it. Which is why I upped it. I love the textures here. Tone is perfect... The reason I am not giving it a 10 is because I would have liked to have seen more.', '2012-05-25 00:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
