(6778044, 1016018, 114969, '<td valign="top">Great one Paul, congratulations on your ribbon. It was my favorite of the challenge, very nicely done: very hard to tell it''s a model at all.</td>', 'Great one Paul, congratulations on your ribbon. It was my favorite of the challenge, very nicely done: very hard to tell it''s a model at all.', '2012-05-25 05:59:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(6778046, 1015581, 114969, '<td valign="top">Great concept, and very nice execution: congratulations on your well deserved ribbon. The concept is very clever and interesting. If I may also add a small criticism, the shadow of the main cloud looks a bit odd to me, like if it was purely 2D and cast on a flat picture: that''s the main thing I would rework in your picture. But I''m nitpicking, good job!</td>', 'Great concept, and very nice execution: congratulations on your well deserved ribbon. The concept is very clever and interesting. If I may also add a small criticism, the shadow of the main cloud looks a bit odd to me, like if it was purely 2D and cast on a flat picture: that''s the main thing I would rework in your picture. But I''m nitpicking, good job!', '2012-05-25 06:07:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6778048, 1016053, 117474, '<td valign="top">got yourself the asigmatic prize again! <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1000203" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1000203.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1000203.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1000203.gif"/></a> <br/>Congrats on your blue.</td>', 'got yourself the asigmatic prize again!  Congrats on your blue.', '2012-05-25 06:23:07.000000', NULL, 0),
