(6778112, 1016075, 138630, '<td valign="top">Sorry, Anita.  I scored this a 3.  I didn''t even think of expert vs advanced vs basic or minimal when I scored this challenge and I had no idea whose any of them were - never do.  Now that I see the blue version (which I would have scored several points higher, maybe a 6) and know that the blur in the center is a person with an umbrella, I actually enjoy the one you entered more.  Guess I''m just not imaginative and sophisticated enough to get this on a couple of passes through.</td>', 'Sorry, Anita.  I scored this a 3.  I didn''t even think of expert vs advanced vs basic or minimal when I scored this challenge and I had no idea whose any of them were - never do.  Now that I see the blue version (which I would have scored several points higher, maybe a 6) and know that the blur in the center is a person with an umbrella, I actually enjoy the one you entered more.  Guess I''m just not imaginative and sophisticated enough to get this on a couple of passes through.', '2012-05-25 09:08:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6778114, 1016053, 38032, '<td valign="top">I have a thing for Magritte. And birds in formation. So this is right up there for me. I wonder if the person was a bit smaller if the scene would be even more grand. Regardless, I''m in love with this one.</td>', 'I have a thing for Magritte. And birds in formation. So this is right up there for me. I wonder if the person was a bit smaller if the scene would be even more grand. Regardless, I''m in love with this one.', '2012-05-25 09:09:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6778117, 1015871, 148818, '<td valign="top">so simple, so elegant, beautiful shot.... very nice....</td>', 'so simple, so elegant, beautiful shot.... very nice....', '2012-05-25 09:17:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(6778128, 1016067, 69008, '<td valign="top">I like the scene, the focus and the composition in this one.  I didn''t vote this challenge, but I thought that this would place much higher.</td>', 'I like the scene, the focus and the composition in this one.  I didn''t vote this challenge, but I thought that this would place much higher.', '2012-05-25 09:34:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(6778154, 1015043, 74911, '<td valign="top">For me, spotting a blue bird and capturing it this sharp before it flies away in itself is a herculian task :) On top of it you have got the snow captured. Awesome. I think this is overly underrated may be because of the expert editing thing. Otherwise this would have been in top 5. Great job!</td>', 'For me, spotting a blue bird and capturing it this sharp before it flies away in itself is a herculian task :) On top of it you have got the snow captured. Awesome. I think this is overly underrated may be because of the expert editing thing. Otherwise this would have been in top 5. Great job!', '2012-05-25 10:13:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(6778158, 1016053, 74911, '<td valign="top">Nowadays your entries get a default Blue ribbon and an extraordinary score. And you make it look so easy. But, I understand you must be spending heck a lot of your family time to bring the picture in your brain on to the monitor. You are certainly one great photographer who has the right blend of creativity and hard work. A lot to learn from you. HUGE congrats!</td>', 'Nowadays your entries get a default Blue ribbon and an extraordinary score. And you make it look so easy. But, I understand you must be spending heck a lot of your family time to bring the picture in your brain on to the monitor. You are certainly one great photographer who has the right blend of creativity and hard work. A lot to learn from you. HUGE congrats!', '2012-05-25 10:23:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(6778166, 1016053, 60495, '<td valign="top">Love the imagination, when I think of rain it would have never occurred to me to make a man shaped tree with a bird shaped pipe that has rainbow smoke coming out of it with a person with an umbrella walking by in the shot. My mind just does not work that way, but I truly enjoy seeing shots like this. Your work always impresses and inspires!</td>', 'Love the imagination, when I think of rain it would have never occurred to me to make a man shaped tree with a bird shaped pipe that has rainbow smoke coming out of it with a person with an umbrella walking by in the shot. My mind just does not work that way, but I truly enjoy seeing shots like this. Your work always impresses and inspires!', '2012-05-25 10:36:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6778184, 1016053, 120171, '<td valign="top">A remarkable image considering by your own admission you were pushed for time, now if I could get some of those creativity pills you have been using I''m sure my average would increase.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on the deserved blue.</td>', 'A remarkable image considering by your own admission you were pushed for time, now if I could get some of those creativity pills you have been using I''m sure my average would increase. Congratulations on the deserved blue.', '2012-05-25 11:10:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(6778188, 1016018, 120171, '<td valign="top">That wooden bat nearly knocked it out of the park. Congrats on the red!</td>', 'That wooden bat nearly knocked it out of the park. Congrats on the red!', '2012-05-25 11:13:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6778191, 1016018, 109387, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully realistic - my favorite in this challenge! Great weeks for you!</td>', 'Wonderfully realistic - my favorite in this challenge! Great weeks for you!', '2012-05-25 11:21:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(6778198, 1016034, 16148, '<td valign="top">Clever shot and I like the grain.  Glad to see this get a Posthumous.</td>', 'Clever shot and I like the grain.  Glad to see this get a Posthumous.', '2012-05-25 11:29:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(6778205, 1016059, 16148, '<td valign="top">Street photography with a pinhole lens isn''t that easy.  Congratulations on you Posthumous.  Very well done!</td>', 'Street photography with a pinhole lens isn''t that easy.  Congratulations on you Posthumous.  Very well done!', '2012-05-25 11:34:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6778234, 1016053, 76335, '<td valign="top">Oh, enough already!</td>', 'Oh, enough already!', '2012-05-25 12:09:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(6778237, 1016053, 143844, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hahn23:</b></div><hr/><i> It''s a beautiful image, but it''s not photographic in nature.  By that, I mean one would never see this with one''s eyes.  It''s a joy to view, but it''s pure fantasy.  Since this is an expert edit challenge, I will mark this 10, but I don''t accept it as a photograph.  Really enjoy your ability to draw and paint.  No offense intended. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Was thinking almost the same!!</td>', 'Originally posted by hahn23: It''s a beautiful image, but it''s not photographic in nature.  By that, I mean one would never see this with one''s eyes.  It''s a joy to view, but it''s pure fantasy.  Since this is an expert edit challenge, I will mark this 10, but I don''t accept it as a photograph.  Really enjoy your ability to draw and paint.  No offense intended.   Was thinking almost the same!!', '2012-05-25 12:18:40.000000', NULL, 0),
