(6778241, 1016075, 50695, '<td valign="top">the image you entered was the best of the 3, imho. I gave you a 6. But on most days I would have scored this higher and given it a comment. I think the nature of the challenge made this image less surprising than it would be normally.</td>', 'the image you entered was the best of the 3, imho. I gave you a 6. But on most days I would have scored this higher and given it a comment. I think the nature of the challenge made this image less surprising than it would be normally.', '2012-05-25 12:22:09.000000', NULL, 0),
