(6780506, 1015581, 49954, '<td valign="top">Great entry and artwork... but another example of DNMC getting a ribbon because of quality.  The theme says the subject should be IN THE RAIN... your subject is clearly out of the rain and bringing it in.  Excellent concept and well presented, but clearly DNMC.</td>', 'Great entry and artwork... but another example of DNMC getting a ribbon because of quality.  The theme says the subject should be IN THE RAIN... your subject is clearly out of the rain and bringing it in.  Excellent concept and well presented, but clearly DNMC.', '2012-05-29 11:55:40.000000', NULL, 0),
